window.products.push({"id":385059,"name":"Ourokhome Rotary Cheese Grater Shredder, Speed Kitchen Manual Round Mandolin Slicer Grinder for Potato Hash Brown, Vegetable, Walnut, Nut, Carrot Garl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bGZUKljrL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"✭ Free Your Hands with Our Rotary Grater Shredder: Your Safety is our priority, the cheese grater takes care of your hands by keeping them away from the blades in using thanks to the food pusher. Even for children. In addition, special designed brush for safety cleaning. 3 blades are top rack dishwasher safe.✭Customers come first: We provide 365 days warranty on transparent barrel and handle, other parts are guaranteed for 30 days. ✭Humanity Design Speed Cheese Grater Slicer: A strong suction base grips securely to CLEAN and SMOOTH countertop for effortless grating. The drum part and blades sit diagonally, so the grated ingredients fall from the vegetable grater smoothly. 3 sharp stainless steel blades include a slicing blade, a coarse shredding blade and a fine shredding blade, which can meet most of your kitchen needs. A handle joins the blade to the barrel. Just turn the handle and the blade rotates quickly. ✭Multifunction Round Mandolin Slicer: Are you still complaining about too many chopping tools in your kitchen? Choose our 3 in 1 versatile speed rotary grater! 3 blades can solve your kitchen slicing, shredding, even coarse grinding jobs. Ideal for grating cheese, potato, carrot, cucumber, zucchini, cookie, beetroot, radish, walnut, nuts, garlic, chocolate, broccoli, cauliflower, etc. for pizza tops, salad, cauliflower rice, hash brown, dessert and so on. ✭Very Easy to Use and very Efficient Speed Hand Grater: It only takes 3 steps to set up the rotary slicer. No require any technology, and No electricity needs. As long as it has a smooth and clean countertop, it will work! With our drum grater, you can shorten the food prep time by 70%. It only takes 60 seconds for a pound of cheese to turn into shredded cheese. This will save you a lot of time preparing your foods. The most important, it can make the tedious preparing food more interesting. ✭Upgraded Transparent Barrel: Thanks to customers’ suggestions, we redesigned the transparent barrel this year, you can completely ignore our comment about the little lid on the transparent barrel, there is no small lid any more.✭Awesome gift choice: It can be a father's Day, Mother's Day, wedding, engagement, retirement, house warming for new home, and Christmas white elephant gifts for dad, mom, grandpa, grandma, husband, wife, son, daughter, and anyone else you want to send a gift to.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bGZUKljrL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ourokhome","source_asin":"B0B252TCWB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B252TCWB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B252TCWB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
