window.products.push({"id":385095,"name":"(Pack of 3) Measured Liquor Bottle Pourers, 0.5 oz, Clear Spout Bottle Pourer with Orange Tail and Black Collar, Measured Pour Spouts by Tezzorio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xVlhfqCfL._AC_.jpg","description":"HOW TO POUR A MEASURED VOLUME OF LIQUID: Step 1 - Before using the pourer, soak it in warm, soapy water for 10-12 minutes, then rinse in cold water. Step 2 – In order to install, wet the cork in warm water and push the pourer straight into the bottle, making sure the collar fits snuggly over the opening. Step 3 - Hold the bottle at a 45-degree angle when pouring. Ensure a naturally pouring motion is used; do not try to \"whip\" or \"baby\" the bottle into pouring position. Step 4 - When the bottle is low, allow liquor to reach the neck of the bottle before tilting the 45-degree angle. Place the spout to the lip of the glass, then raise the tail of the bottle. Step 5 - To wash, soak the pourer in warm, soapy water, then rinse in cold water. Step 6 - If a cork fin flattens, run it under hot water for approximately 30 seconds, then run under cold water. This will straighten the fins. To remove, twist and pull straight up out of the bottle. For best performance with spirits, we recommend to wash it weekly, when used with cordials, syrups, or juices, wash nightly. NOTE: Do not run through the dishwasher or wash in extremely hot water. Pourers will not be effective with water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xVlhfqCfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tezzorio","source_asin":"B07CGY3L79","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385095","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CGY3L79","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CGY3L79","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":385096,"name":"Koyal Wholesale Crystal Stone Place Card Holders for Names, Photos, Table Numbers for Modern Vintage Antique Farmhouse Wedding, Brunch, Events and Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FSCsh75IL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"NATURAL GEODE STONES: Try a non-traditional approach to your table settings with gemstone placecard holders. Sold as a set of 12, each place cardholder has a geode stone as its base with a slender holder to display your table number or wedding guest names. Pair with other natural stones as centerpieces, geode stones are decorative pieces as well as useful as place card holders. Select from 4 different types of gem crystal place card holders for a modern bohemian wedding reception. UNIQUE SHAPE: Made from geode stone, each placecard holder has a natural color and true to its natural, unique shape. Well-crafted place card holders, select from rose quartz, blue celestite, amethyst crystal, or half-cut geode. The beautiful agate stones are sold as a set of 12 and are perfect for your wedding, special events, or home decor. The gemstones can be used collectively as the colors complement one another for a boho-chic or beach theme. SET OF 12: Each gemstone place card takes on a natural rock shape. Two designs include a gold foil at the base and the jeweled place cards will compliment your event's decor. These natural gems are perfect for bulk orders and can be used for table settings and other decor items. From guest name settings to use as food and bar signs, placing gemstones like amethyst and rose quartz crystal geodes are perfect. Create several types of party themes with these high-quality geode stone place cards. WEDDING DECOR: Whether a coastal beach theme wedding or planning for a more bohemian reception, geode place cards will tie the theme together well. Perfect for bulk orders, so you can order place cards to boldly display each guest's name. Gemstone place cards can also be used at the dessert table, bar, or hold pictures of the lovely couple as an added intimate touch. The natural white of the half-cut geode place cards is perfect for a beach or even a nautical theme wedding. HOME DECOR: Decorative photo holders or memo holder stands around your home can truly make your design special. The geode stones can be used to add modern glam to your vanity or home office desk. Or place throughout your living and dining rooms to hold small pictures, memories, or notes. Get creative and place on your coffee tables or console alongside stone or other natural gems.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FSCsh75IL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Koyal Wholesale","source_asin":"B09CYSW92V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYSW92V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYSW92V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
