window.products.push({"id":385143,"name":"Cousins Personalized Alder Wood Photo Frame","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b0Wrp-OKL._AC_.jpg","description":"These quality frames are made from Alder wood and engrave beautifully. This natural wood is hard and durable and will go with any decor. Glass is also included to protect your photo or design. Size available 4 x 6. Picture inserts made easy! No need to bend picture points out of the way with a screwdriver to place your picture, mat, drawing or document in this frame. Simply turn the clasp, lift up and out, add your picture and mat if you want, slide the easel back into place, turn the clasp to secure it in place and you are ready to stand or hang your frame. The frame comes with an easel back to stand or hang on the wall either vertical or horizontal. The inside of the frame is grooved (routed) so the easel back fits secure and tight and is held in place by a clasp. These frames come either as a engraved or we can personalize it for you with a name or names of your choice. You choose either a horizontal or vertical frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b0Wrp-OKL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crafters Outpost","source_asin":"B0194A0GWI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194A0GWI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194A0GWI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
