window.products.push({"id":385187,"name":"Coffee Mug, 17OZ Coffee Tumblers with Straws and Straw Brushes, Travel Coffee Mug with Leakproof Lid for Keep Hot & Cold Water Coffee and Tea In Trave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tq2smOI7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Portable Coffee Mug with Straw&Brush】HouseTec Coffee Mug is an excellent travel companion for coffee lovers on the go.Its lightweight design fits most cup holders and coffee machines, making it easy to take anywhere.The flip lid opens and locks easily, making it effortless to drink from,while the protruding part of the lid ensures that you can easily locate the drinking hole without looking.comes with straws and straw brushes,providing you with more value and convenience than other coffee mugs 【Superior Insulation Technology】Crafted from high-quality 18/8 stainless steel, the HouseTec coffee travel mug features advanced double-wall vacuum insulation technology that keeps your drinks hot for up to 6 hours and cold for up to 12 hours. The coffee tumbler interior is made of premium 304 food-grade stainless steel that is rust-free, odorless, and lead-free. The BPA-free silicone lid is durable and ensures maximum temperature retention. 【Absolutely Leakproof Design】Spill proof travel coffee mug With screw-in threaded cup lid is equipped with a sealing ring, which provides a good leak-proof effect. Anti-fingerprint matte surface, comfortable to touch. The air vent on the mouthpiece, allows beverages to flow smoothly, without gushing or overflowing. You can put it in your car, bag, and backpack without fear of leakage. 【Fits Most Cup Holders】HouseTec coffee mug is great for daily life and outdoor adventures and fits most vehicle cup holders, home, office, camping, traveling, at the beach, hiking, sporting activities, picnics, or just about any other activity you can dream up. This sturdy and durable quality, carefully designed, durable, fall-proof, and rust-proof, is Better than plastic or glass bottles. This coffee tumbler is also a good Ideal for business gifts and family gifts 【Excellent Gift Choice】HouseTec coffee mug with straws and straw brushes makes an excellent gift for birthdays, anniversaries, weddings, Valentine's Day, Christmas, and other special occasions. It is an ideal gift for coffee lovers, professionals, travelers, and anyone who wants to enjoy their favorite beverage on the go. 【Friendly Satisfied Warranty】HouseTec coffee mug with lid is of high quality, which can long-term high-intensity use. HouseTec is striving to provide a high-quality travel coffee cup and excellent customer service. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions about the HouseTec coffee tumbler. HouseTec provides 2 years warranty and 180-day refund service. HouseTec coffee thermos is unique among coffee cups in the way, which is built to last and should perform well over time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tq2smOI7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elayce","source_asin":"B0BZQ9JSNZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385187","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZQ9JSNZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZQ9JSNZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
