window.products.push({"id":385291,"name":"Custom Cordless Cellular Shades,White Dove (Privacy & Light Filtering) Inside Mount,W:70\" xH:48\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":183.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o1eos79ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chicology Top Down Bottom Up Cordless Cellular Shades take adaptable light-control to a new level with its bi-directional cordless lift mechanism. The TDBU shade allows simultaneous raising and lowering from the top and bottom of the shade. If you haven't seen this before, it'll create a big \"Wow\" effect for your guests, creating a truly beautiful custom window treatments look. Do you want to create privacy but still enjoy some light during the day? Try opening the shade just a bit from the top. Want even more light? Try also opening it from the middle, and create a floating shade effect. Adjust each shade to find the perfect ambience and create the right level of privacy for your home. The rich crisp fabric is available in a range of stunning beautiful array of colors, from White Dove, Cotton, Fawn, Gray Sheen, Winter White, and Warm Cocoa. Each color is light filtering with privacy, so you can enjoy a gentle shade and beautiful fabric textures against sunlight. These Cellular Shades are customized for your window frame. They’ll be customized to your perfect size in our California warehouse to fit snugly in your windows. You can select any width from 24 to 72 inches. For the height, you can choose from a 48 to 72 inch drop, which have a minimal stack size. For Inside Mount, enter the dimesion of your window casing - do not make any deductions. Minimum of 1.5 inch depth is required for installation. 2 inch depth is required for flush inside mount installation. For Outside Mount, tell us the total size the blind should be - your shade will be made to exactly those specs. Honeycome cells are a great heat and draft barrier, keeping your home cool in the summer heat and keeping the warmth secure inside during the winter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61o1eos79ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHICOLOGY","source_asin":"B087DPFSFP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385291","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087DPFSFP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087DPFSFP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
