window.products.push({"id":385335,"name":"Monysun 2 Pack Oil Sprayer for Cooking, Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle Spray Mister, Portable Refillable Oil Vinegar Spritzer Sprayer Bottles for Kitchen,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fbplobQEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"🎀[Healthy Diet For Oil Control]: Healthy living starts with oil control. Easily control the amount of olive oil you and your family consume with our spray nozzle, spraying instead of pouring and reducing calories. Efficient use, no waste. Improved taste and healthier. 🎀[Bigger Opening, Bigger Oil Mist]: The oil sprayer's large opening makes it easy to fill the kitchen oil spray bottle without a funnel, and the specially designed locking bottle seals tightly to prevent leaks. We have enlarged the nozzle of the oil spray bottle to give a larger spray area and a finer mist of oil to evenly coat your food for oil control and calorie reduction. 🎀[Ergonomic Handle]: The non-slip and ergonomic handle design allows your hand to comfortably hold the lid and handle, producing a fine, even mist of oil with a simple click and ease of use. (Tip: The best way to spray is to hold the sprayer at 45 degrees. If the bottom of the straw is oriented differently from the nozzle, pull out the straw and adjust the orientation.) 🎀[Safe And Healthy Materials]: Our dispensers are made of food grade material, BPA free and 100% food safe. The transparent and durable PET material makes it easy for chefs to identify the amount of oil and seasoning. They're light and strong compared to other glass bottles, so you never have to worry about breaking them! 🎀[Multi-Purpose Spray Bottle]: Ours is the perfect tool for the home and kitchen. You can add various condiments such as olive oil, cooking oil, sunflower oil, lemon, lime juice, sauces, sherry or wine. It can also be used to spray alcohol and water to clean your kitchen and furniture, and to water your plants.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fbplobQEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monysun","source_asin":"B09B6V5F6Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B6V5F6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B6V5F6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
