window.products.push({"id":385443,"name":"KERIQI Air Fryer Disposable Paper Liners, 100PCS Non-Stick Parchment Liner, Oil Resistant, Waterproof, Food Grade Baking Paper for Baking Roasting Mic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6176myorOmL._AC_SL1450_.jpg","description":"Start a smarter and healthier kitchen life with air fryer disposable paper liner. 1.Does it work well without ventilation holes? The air fryer paper liners can work without holes. The heat is generated by air circulation from the pan's wall, and it won't affect the air circulation by using disposable paper liners. When baking, the grease comes out to the paper liner, giving you healthier foods. 2.Are these liners unbleached? Our air fryer disposable paper liners are unbleached, made of raw wood, original color, all are made of food grade materials. Strict quality control, unbleached, no fluorescent agent, BPA-free, PFAs-free. 3.Is this item easy to use? These disposable paper liner comes within a box, do not need to be torn or cut, and can be placed directly in when preparing a meal. Paper has a 4.5cm edge that protects the side of the frying pan and prevents food from sticking to them. See-Thru plastic box package easy to take out product and can see the remaining amount. Air Fryer Paper Liners Inner Diameter: 16cm/ 6.3inches Quantity Per Pack: 100 pcs Shape: Round Important Hint： 1. Heat-resistance temperature: 428°F（220℃） 2. No exposure to fire directly 3. Do not put empty paper liners during preheating 4. The food used should not be too little, so as to avoid the hot air blowing the air fryer paper to the heating air duct, causing the paper plate to burn 5. Manual measurement, please kindly allow the little tolerance in item size","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6176myorOmL._AC_SL1450_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KERIQI","source_asin":"B0B87WT69N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B87WT69N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B87WT69N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":385444,"name":"Homak 12-Bin Portable Plastic Storage Organizer, HA01112019","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kw4JyFJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This portable plastic storage organizer includes removable storage bins. Features include; textured aluminum carrying handle, dual aluminum latching system and a transparent plastic lid for easy viewing of contents. From the Manufacturer Homak Manufacturing was founded in 1947 in Chicago by Sigmund H. Danziger. The name \"Homak\" was coined after a sign that Sigmund saw on a hat store. Originally a manufacturer of steel kitchen cabinets, Homak Expanded its product offerings in the 1960s to included a separate line of hardware products such as toolboxes, tool cabinets, and other accessories. Homak's hardware line remained strong and was accepted in many major retail businesses of its time. Following Sigmund's death in 1979, his wife, Gertrude, ran the company for 25 years. Under Gertrude's guidance, Homak extended its product line with automotive, hospital, and sporting goods. In January of 2005 Homak was acquired by JVA and moved its office to western Pennsylvania. Its facility now resides in the Wampum Underground Commerce Center. Today, Homak emphasizes tool storage and gun cabinet security. The full product line consists of hand-carry toolboxes, tool bags, parts organizers, tool storage cabinets, workbenches, garage furniture, safety cabinets, spill containment systems, P.B & E. products, steel lockers, gun cabinets, fire-resistant safes, ammo storage boxes and accessories. Each item is manufactured to exceed customer's expectations, and to provide strength and dependability to the customer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kw4JyFJAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HMC Holdings LLC - Homak","source_asin":"B07MMJ7YDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMJ7YDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMJ7YDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
