window.products.push({"id":385452,"name":"Costzon Kids Vanity Set with Mirror, 2 in 1 Princess Makeup Dressing Table w/Detachable Top, Toddler Vanity with 360° Rotating Mirror, Drawers & Stool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":94.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611CbW4H9jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"360° Rotating Mirror & 3 Drawers: The vanity table comes with an oval mirror with high definition, offering a clear view for kids to do makeup and hair. And the mirror can spin 360 degrees to achieve a perfect reflection. Meanwhile, 3 drawers of this dressing table provide large space to store kids' jewelry, cosmetics, combs, brushes, etc. Dual Use with Detachable Top: The top part of this pretend play makeup table can be moved away, so your child can use this table as a writing desk to read books, draw pictures, eat snacks or play games. In addition, the matching stool gives your child a stable place to sit and can be tucked under the table when not in use to save space. Secure Child-sized Vanity Set: Considering children's safety, this vanity table and stool set is designed with round corners and smooth edges. With the lovely appearance and perfect size, your kids will enjoy their own sized furniture. Size of the table: 27.5\" × 13\" × 39\" (L × W × H); size of the stool: 13\" × 9\" × 12.5\" (L × W × H). Sturdy Wooden Construction: Made of selected MDF material, this kids dressing table and stool set is stable and durable. Curved legs with anti-slip foot pads enhance the stability while protecting the floor from getting scratched. More, the table comes with an anti-toppling device to fix it to the wall to reduce tipping over accidents. Easy to Assemble & Clean: This kids makeup table and stool set comes with detailed instruction for you to follow. And along with necessary hardware, you can complete the assembly work in a short time. Besides, the vanity set features a smooth and waterproof surface, which is convenient to clean just with a wet cloth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611CbW4H9jL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B09J1MN76Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-385452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J1MN76Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J1MN76Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
